Package: orvanta-control-center
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets
Description: ORVANTA graphical system overview
 Read-only Qt dashboard for ORVANTA OS that shows the distribution name,
 hostname, load average, memory use, root filesystem use, uptime, and
 whether the nftables firewall and remote-access services are running.
 .
 This is a development prototype: it never changes system state and has no
 privileged backend. Administrative modules are placeholders.
